* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* Member    C-EOMERR
* Function  Standard Copycode for ON-ERROR Routine
*
* Maintenance
* uuuuuu yyyy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* fhi    2000-08-24           created.
* fhi    2010-09-21 NOMALL-97 Use no more C-NATERR but C-NATERN instead
* --------------------------------------- on error ---------------------
ON ERROR
  DECIDE ON FIRST *ERROR-NR
    VALUE 3009,3145
      EOMMSG-NR := *ERROR-NR
    NONE
      EOMMSG-NR := 0021
      CALLNAT 'C-NATERN' EOMMSG-TOKEN (1)
  END-DECIDE
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-ERROR
